{"games":[{"id":17382280326,"name":"The Robloxia: Until Dawn","desc":"THIS GAME CONTAINS FLASHING LIGHTS\n\nWelcome to The Robloxia: Until Dawn, a game that tries to turn popular classic roblox myths and etc. all together into a survival game, team up with with 5 more survivors against different killers and try to escape their grip, or play as them and eliminate everyone on sight before the portal spawns.\n\nTook concepts, soundtracks and inspiration from:\n- Sonic.EXE: The Disaster (RIP)\n- Sonic.EXE: Spectral Fades\n- Left4Dead2\n- Mob of the dead\n\nSome soundtracks are used without permission as said composers were quite hard to contact, if you own a soundtrack that is used in the game and can prove that it is made by you then please join our community server and contact me there, it will be replaced if needed. All credits are in the game.\n\nI do not own any licenses of any un-official/original soundtracks used in the game, nor any rights to anything else. This is just a passion project for fun\n\nOriginally made on February 10th 2023","path":"/game/17382280326-the-robloxia-until-dawn","slug":"17382280326-the-robloxia-until-dawn","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/897a29520e495edb72984f1ab6955a45e45b32b7d2bb6096cc3f9e249ca84b0c.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-146155c5b8ec395cf963c0d39a296746/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":0,"visitor":21627158,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-02-24T02:28:06.161Z","creator":{"name":"The Robloxia: Until Dawn community","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":20,"freeCount":17,"keyCount":4,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":17218259625,"name":"Who's the Spy?","desc":"👍 LIKE the game and join the group to get Free Baby High Chair and Reveal Spy!\n\n👑 Create private server and play with friends to get Free Admin Commands.\n🎮 Admin Commands: Set how many spies, set who will be the spies, set who will create the secret words.\n\nHow to Play:\n🎲 You will be given a random secret word.\n💬 Describe the word in a general manner but never tell the exact word. Anyone can be a spy.\n🕵️‍♂️ Find out who is the spy and kick out of the game to win!\n\nINNOCENTS: Help each other to know who is the spy. Vote the possible spy to eliminate.\nSPY: Pretend like you are not spy, eliminate all innocents and stay throughout the game to win.\n\n💬 Earn wins and coins to roll cool chairs, purchase tables and unlock colorful text colors, background colors, font styles.\n\n⭐ 2 Game Modes to have fun\nWordless Spy: The spy does not know the secret word of innocents but aware he is the spy.\nSpy with Word: The spy has different secret word compared to innocents but clueless he is the spy.","path":"/game/17218259625-who-s-the-spy","slug":"17218259625-who-s-the-spy","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/d5504bd10be59e64d4866bbf13bab1d0817330cbe68aec0cac7dace581c78853.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-2ef3e5e676aba4210fa5f9433f5e8a26/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":0,"visitor":50347466,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-04-12T22:21:35.288Z","creator":{"name":"Favorite Game!","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":15,"freeCount":15,"keyCount":1,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":17781237968,"name":"Tycoon But One Dropper [RELEASE]","desc":"it is essentially just a tycoon game but with a twist... you only have one dropper? (as the name of the game suggests)\n\nbut how will this work? well, you have some cool upgraders\n\nyou unlock new ways to generate money as you progress through the game.\n\nwill you reach the top of the leaderboards?\n\nENJOY THE GAME!!!\n\n-- if it is too laggy, try using a private server (they are free)\n\n-- this game may have some bugs, but please be patient, as I will fix them as quickly as possible\n","path":"/game/17781237968-tycoon-but-one-dropper","slug":"17781237968-tycoon-but-one-dropper","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/1f4194b303ece32c0bebb61167b60a16c1007d2283d282e17e980105d9e32b23.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-1b2af722c0aad79a133630c3